{
  "id": "section-your-character",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Your Character\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1209,1224]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Give your character a name and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1224,1255]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "create a mental image of him or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1255,1287]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "her. If nothing comes to your mind,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1287,1323]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "just think of a character from your\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1323,1359]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "favorite TV series or movie.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1359,1388]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Character creation is simple, but if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1388,1425]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you want to jump straight into the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1425,1460]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "action, you can use one of the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1460,1491]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "ready character at the end of the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1491,1525]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "book.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1525,1531]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Your character begins with:\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1531,1559]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● Two statistics (Sanity and Life).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1559,1595]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● 2 Skills of your choice (NOT\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1595,1626]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Arcane Skills).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1626,1642]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● 1 weapon from the Random\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1642,1669]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Weapon table (p.20) and 1 knife.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1669,1702]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● 1 item from the  Random\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1702,1728]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Objects table (p.22)  and 1 from\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1728,1761]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the Useful Stuff table (p.25).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1761,1792]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Reroll duplicates.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1792,1811]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": " Life and Sanity are set at 8 each.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1811,1847]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You have 3 additional points to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1847,1879]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "distribute to either stats as you see\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1879,1917]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "fit.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1917,1921]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "For example, you could have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,22,50]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Life 8 and Sanity 11, or Life 10\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,50,83]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and Sanity 9, or Life 11 and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,83,112]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Sanity 8.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,112,122]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may also use the extra 3 points\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,122,158]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to gain an additional Skill or an\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,158,192]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "additional roll on the Random\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,192,222]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Weapon table, the Random Object\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,222,254]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "table, or the Useful Stuff table, your\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,254,293]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-your-character:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "choice.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,293,301]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    8,
    10
  ]
}
